# Who reviews what (MARKETPLACE.md section 3.2, SECURITY.md section 9.7). Every pull request needs a code
# owner's review; a namespace's entries go to its owners (publishers.yaml) and to Weftline's reviewers.
*                       @weftline/marketplace-reviewers
/catalog/               @weftline/marketplace-reviewers
/catalog/*/weftline/    @weftline/marketplace-reviewers
/artifacts/             @weftline/marketplace-reviewers
/publishers.yaml        @weftline/security
/targets.yaml           @weftline/marketplace-reviewers
/revocations/           @weftline/security
/.github/               @weftline/security
/tools/                 @weftline/security
/CODEOWNERS             @weftline/security
